{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/home.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-16T14:54:52.511851Z","id":"162d9491a4acf54eb8970f5ce6c4839c89bc2ab35a82966f52615927ebf6f977","body":{"detail":"Renders in target/flutter-app/home/ next to target/flutter-app/x4/launcher-*.png: same grid, sizes and tonal colours (TONES in home.js, taken from ColorScheme.fromSeed), but e.g. the money word shows a piggy-bank outline instead of Icons.savings_rounded, and Inbox/Settings are outlines. Text uses kit.css --k-font (Roboto on Android, SF in desktop Chromium), so desktop renders wrap labels slightly differently from Flutter's Roboto.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":67},"end":{"line":100},"content_hash":"d7d64b6afa60a5fea86c68409ef6ce2b7a5ddd2f12f2989bd53973b78ab6b717"},"summary":"The home app draws icon words, the top bar and the making states with Lucide line glyphs, where the Flutter launcher (lib/ui/launcher.dart iconFor, Icons.*) uses filled Material icons; tile layout and colours match, the glyph style does not","tags":["home-app","visual","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/home.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:00:08.529522Z","id":"589bb563df256bfd2b391c12f866fbc9693ea7f4b791a8be4962f22b5f17a988","body":{"detail":"Failure: in the Clax app on Android, a long press on an app tile with no tap in the previous 5 s (for example the first touch after opening Clax, or after reading the grid for a while) shows no menu. usePress calls onHold from a setTimeout at 500 ms (line 179) or from the contextmenu event (line 187); both come while the finger is down. Touch pointerdown and contextmenu are not activation-triggering input (only touch pointerup/touchend are), and web/shell/src/caps/home.ts rejects every non-read call with no_gesture unless frameGesture() holds, whose first condition is navigator.userActivation.isActive (web/shell/src/caps/gesture.ts:550). AppTile (line 211) drops the rejected promise silently. web/e2e/home-app.spec.ts and tests/home.test.js run over kit/fake-home.js, which never checks gestures, so nothing exercises this path; right-click (mousedown grants activation) works.","kind":"blocker","span":{"start":{"line":161},"end":{"line":194},"content_hash":"bf170eb53b45e59c992ba1781234d270c5db1f441d793d737a321031888f2bc8"},"suggested_fix":"On touch, arm the hold at 500 ms (pressed style, optional haptic through the host) and call home.menu on that press's pointerup, which grants activation, still swallowing its click; keep the immediate call for mouse/contextmenu from a mouse. Alternatively Task 1's shell handler could accept a host-attested held press (hostArrival.pending, web/shell/src/caps/gesture.ts:576) for menu. Pin it with an app-mode e2e through the real shell (web/e2e/app-host.ts) holding a touch with no prior tap.","summary":"A touch long press calls home.menu while the finger is still down, before the touch grants user activation, so the shell refuses it with no_gesture and nothing happens","tags":["review","task:home-2","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/home.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:00:08.529648Z","id":"6b9d0c3e20fdad2311d67a22fe765868660beb92f5de9c7c3f0f8822ae081486","body":{"detail":"Every action handler calls home.<action>() and ignores the promise. The contract (web/contract/clax-extensions.d.ts, ClaxExtensions.Home) rejects with no_gesture, bad_request (an app deleted since the last apps event) or unavailable; the person sees a tap that does nothing and the page logs an unhandled rejection the agent's tests may count as an error.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":211},"end":{"line":211},"content_hash":"de0bfc13c1c40ecfb28868722ecddb65acaa88388541edc8aadd13f3ce1153e4"},"suggested_fix":"Catch action rejections in one helper; on bad_request reload apps(), otherwise show a short toast.","summary":"Rejected home actions (open, menu, newApp, openInbox, …) are dropped silently and surface as unhandled promise rejections","tags":["review","task:home-2","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/home.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:00:08.529691Z","id":"e021c1f79f0e307262a9ae143a180920ae29aaaba1270688cf881e4dd13b57ab","body":{"detail":"The home app reloads only on an event without data or the Try again button shown when apps() failed with no list yet. A person used to pulling down to refresh gets nothing; if the host misses an event the grid stays stale until the app is reopened.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":363},"end":{"line":395},"content_hash":"123192fc9c2e8cccfd433afbf271695e2a312c06c6e2b7ab6cf143349572c03a"},"suggested_fix":"Reload all four topics on an overscroll pull at the top, or rely on Task 3's re-subscribe on resume and record that as the decision.","summary":"The launcher's pull-to-refresh (RefreshIndicator onRefresh: _load, lib/ui/launcher.dart) has no counterpart in the home app","tags":["review","task:home-2","parity","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/home.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:00:08.530330Z","id":"4065cba52cf521fab9df04f723ec8fcf05b4354e0f18e93909c2f4992002bdd8","body":{"detail":"tests/home.test.js covers live updates and failures, but not an apps() answer that resolves after an apps event, which is the case the seq counter exists for.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":320},"end":{"line":348},"content_hash":"989a6d5c360f709cb74c3a2f1917c87ead8afd894281c1deef5429e8bdf006f3"},"suggested_fix":"Add a test with a fake whose apps() resolves on demand: fire set({apps}) first, then resolve the stale answer, and expect the event's list to stay.","summary":"useTopic's ordering rule (an answer older than a shown event is dropped) has no test","tags":["review","task:home-2","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/home.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:08:47.973235Z","id":"c54ff12c6b5e708cb377855645006544f8189a1c01f593d3ec75f59745f6fdef","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:98b3721f","summary":"usePress arms the tile at 500 ms and calls onHold on that press's pointerup (activation-granting for touch). Evidence: web/e2e/home-app.spec.ts 'a touch long press arms the tile, and its release asks the app for the menu, which the shell accepts' waits for navigator.userActivation to lapse, touches via CDP with host attestations, and passes (npx playwright test e2e/home-app.spec.ts: 8 passed); with the menu called from the timer instead it fails (Received [available, apps, makes, unread, needsKey], no menu).","supersedes":"589bb563df256bfd2b391c12f866fbc9693ea7f4b791a8be4962f22b5f17a988","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/home.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:08:47.982020Z","id":"8205ef764494f33a8e80ac63b6eab7f2bf1df2e93dad5f835d726b4e82ad46d6","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:98b3721f","summary":"Every action goes through useActions' act(), which catches rejections: no_gesture shows 'Tap again to …' and retries on the next tap on no other control, bad_request 'That app is no longer here', others 'Couldn't …'. Evidence: tests/home.test.js 'an action refused for want of a tap…', 'a tap on another control drops a refused action…', 'other failed actions say what went wrong' pass in the inspect view (19 passed, 0 failed).","supersedes":"6b9d0c3e20fdad2311d67a22fe765868660beb92f5de9c7c3f0f8822ae081486","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/home.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:08:47.990486Z","id":"911f1f2a4cd91cdc8a801712a3b0336acf4a6935625bb0df2260daf71887215d","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:98b3721f","summary":"usePull adds pull-to-refresh from the top (a ring past 64 px reloads apps, makes, unread and key), and More > Refresh does the same with a mouse or keyboard. Evidence: tests/home.test.js 'a pull down from the top loads everything again' and 'Refresh in More loads everything again' pass in the inspect view (19 passed, 0 failed).","supersedes":"e021c1f79f0e307262a9ae143a180920ae29aaaba1270688cf881e4dd13b57ab","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/home.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-18T03:25:53.367674Z","id":"7a2b0b7a8a9f79119337b5eebad11a4b3977bcbc5b5b0e5c5bc05d23890270e0","body":{"detail":"useActions keeps a no_gesture call (home.js:428) and retries it on the next tap (home.js:444) with a fresh act() whose value nobody reads; openApp and menuOf chain their layout change (opened, star, unstar) onto the first act's promise, which resolved undefined. So an app opened through the retry keeps its New mark and gets no open counted, and Star or Unstar picked from a retried menu does nothing. A fix is for act to keep its promise pending across the retry and resolve it with the retried call's value (undefined if the kept call is dropped).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":608},"end":{"line":614},"content_hash":"a8d2dcdf0025eecddbeed729325bb59fa7130553b70481282efdfcf024e0c5fb"},"summary":"An open or a menu retried from the 'Tap again' notice is not counted and its picked item is dropped","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/home/home.js","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-18T03:29:40.697806Z","id":"126f73da421860df5c78c0316270602d24f72cbab5888ac706e8287485a6dd13","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:784edb454","summary":"useActions keeps the act() promise pending across a no_gesture retry and resolves it with the retried call's value (undefined when dropped), so openApp's opened() and menuOf's star/unstar apply. Test 'an open or a menu retried from the notice keeps its change: the open counts, the picked Star stars' in apps/clax_app/home/tests/home.test.js fails before (waitFor gave up after 3000 ms) and passes after: pnpm exec playwright test --project=rest e2e/home-app.spec.ts -> 9 passed, harness passed 31.","supersedes":"7a2b0b7a8a9f79119337b5eebad11a4b3977bcbc5b5b0e5c5bc05d23890270e0","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
